{"ID":"20240314092128-pwof2wx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092128-pwof2wx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092128-pwof2wx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161746-sjh3lud\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161746-i9zbzcd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161746-i9zbzcd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:61,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:61\u0026#125;","title":"【厚朴七物汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422161746-sjh3lud","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-sjh3lud","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病腹满，发热十日，脉浮而数，饮食如故，厚朴七物汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-eshik4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-eshik4n","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴七物汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-glg2mhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-glg2mhr","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴半斤，甘草、大黄各三两，大枣十枚，枳实五枚，桂枝二两，生姜五两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-3uxx00x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-3uxx00x","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水一斗，煮取四升，温服八合，日三服。呕者加半夏五合，下利去大黄，寒多者加生姜至半斤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-otsr803","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-otsr803","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人就是腹满，现在都在介绍腹满，如果发热十天，脉浮而数，饮食如故，厚朴七物汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-lvlpyj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-lvlpyj3","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个证呢，如果我们用比较专业的术语来看，叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳阳明合病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，合病发生的现象。还没看到这边的解释，我们先看后面，看看什么是厚朴七物汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-n21dx1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-n21dx1k","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴、大黄、枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个药拿掉，剩下的桂枝生姜甘草大枣，是不是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊?老师，桂枝汤少了个白芍!哦，你注意看哦，阴阳哦。它白芍不见了。为什么呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为白芍是腹痛，腹痛才会用白芍，它不是啊，它是腹满啊，没有腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是第一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-8jzalpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-8jzalpt","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，你如果说，这个脉浮而数，饮食如故，我们病人有数脉代表里面肠胃有堵到，胃口还是很好，吃东西还是很好。但是东西堵到了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-cha432m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-cha432m","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个发热是已经有些阳明症的现象了。当然，你可以直接开这个，这个叫什么，小承气汤。但是呢，病人有浮脉，浮脉代表有些风寒，有些表症在上面，这时我们用桂枝就好了。那我刚刚讲过，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"删掉白芍，那是因为它没有痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这七味药呢，一般我们用九碗水煮成三碗，大致看看里边的剂量有多少，你就配有多少水下去煮。如果呕吐的加半夏，下利把大黄拿掉，病人已经有下利了把大黄拿掉，寒多加生姜，重用生姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-ij39s0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-ij39s0y","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个厚朴七物汤，用在太阳阳明合并的时候。肚子里面呢，有实，所以呢，我们采用攻下。这就是为什么小承气汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍呢，主酸收，它是收敛的，我们要攻下，又要去收敛它，是矛盾的，所以白芍拿掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这样了解我的意思吧。所以我一再跟各位强调，如果我们用比较白话的来讲，当静脉，你发现到静脉流回心脏的速度不够的时候，就是你要重用白芍的时候。所以脚冷，静脉瘤，静脉虚张，女人妇科的痛，脾脏肿大...脾主血，脾统血啊，脾脏肿大，脾血没有办法回流回心脏，这个时候就是你重用白芍的时机，任何腹部、肚子啊，少腹的问题啊都得重用白芍。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161746-i9zbzcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161746-i9zbzcd","updated":"20240422161746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里呢，我们要攻下，攻下怎么可以用收敛的药方在里面呢？这是不 match 的，不合的。所以白芍踢掉，这个是比较专业的讲法。"}]}]}